text = "Hi! Welcome to the game.

This game consists of 4 days where each day you have to figure out 
who the mutiny leader is and make them walk the plank.

Choose right on all 4 days to win!

Controls:
WASD - Movement
Space - Interact
Arrow Keys/Mouse - Dialogue"

